      "headline": "Can Foreigners Own Property in Egypt? The Rules, the Limits, and the Five-Year Restriction",
      "description": "Foreigners can own property in Egypt, but the law sets limits on how many units, how large, and — critically — when you are allowed to sell. Here is what Law 230 of 1996 actually says.",
